{"id":"130e7b3ddfdf29f6","group":"58","path":"58/batch13/58-thm-splitting.md","title":"Splitting Number","display":"thm-splitting — Splitting Number","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-splitting","aliases":["58-thm-splitting"],"display":"thm-splitting — Splitting Number","depends_on":["[[../batch10/58-df-splitting-number.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-omega1.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-continuum.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-splitting"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-splitting</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-splitting — Splitting Number"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"158e8447c69f47ed\" href=\"?note=158e8447c69f47ed\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-splitting-number.md\">../batch10/58-df-splitting-number.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"27ae6ad867a7007d\" href=\"?note=27ae6ad867a7007d\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-omega1.md\">../batch17/58-df-omega1.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"99c5552e170feee3\" href=\"?note=99c5552e170feee3\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-continuum.md\">../batch02/58-df-continuum.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak{s}\">\\(\\mathfrak{s}\\)</span> (splitting number, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"158e8447c69f47ed\" href=\"?note=158e8447c69f47ed\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-splitting-number.md\">../batch10/58-df-splitting-number.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega_1\">\\(\\omega_1\\)</span> (first uncountable cardinal, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"27ae6ad867a7007d\" href=\"?note=27ae6ad867a7007d\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-omega1.md\">../batch17/58-df-omega1.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak{c}\">\\(\\mathfrak{c}\\)</span> (continuum, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"99c5552e170feee3\" href=\"?note=99c5552e170feee3\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-continuum.md\">../batch02/58-df-continuum.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCiSplittingNumber}_S(\\mathfrak s)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCiSplittingNumber}_S(\\mathfrak s)\\)</span> (splitting-number predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\mathfrak s)\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\mathfrak s)\\)</span> (cardinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}splitting}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcCiSplittingNumber}_S(\\mathfrak s)\n\\to\n\\left(\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\mathfrak s)\n\\land\\omega_1\\leq\\mathfrak s\\leq\\mathfrak c\n\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}splitting}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcCiSplittingNumber}_S(\\mathfrak s)\n\\to\n\\left(\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\mathfrak s)\n\\land\\omega_1\\leq\\mathfrak s\\leq\\mathfrak c\n\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>No countable family splits every infinite subset of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>, while a family of size at most <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak c\">\\(\\mathfrak c\\)</span> does.</li>\n<li>The strict inequality <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak s&lt;\\mathfrak c\">\\(\\mathfrak s&lt;\\mathfrak c\\)</span> is relatively consistent, but it is not a consequence of Martin's Axiom; full MA instead implies <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak s=\\mathfrak c\">\\(\\mathfrak s=\\mathfrak c\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch10/58-df-splitting-number.md","status":"resolved","id":"158e8447c69f47ed","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-splitting-number.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-omega1.md","status":"resolved","id":"27ae6ad867a7007d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-omega1.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-continuum.md","status":"resolved","id":"99c5552e170feee3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-continuum.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-splitting-number.md","status":"resolved","id":"158e8447c69f47ed","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathfrak{s}$ (splitting number, see [[../batch10/58-df-splitting-number.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-omega1.md","status":"resolved","id":"27ae6ad867a7007d","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\omega_1$ (first uncountable cardinal, see [[../